Scoped pixdesctest video filter

The pixdesctest descriptor in src/video-ops/pixdesctest.ts follows
libavfilter/vf_pixdesctest.c (config_props, filter_frame and the
ff_vf_pixdesctest registration, which has no query_formats): every component
is read and written back through the pixel descriptor into a fresh buffer, so
for the storage formats of the negotiation table frames reach the output unchanged.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
